{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19275","headline":"和令狐相公玩白菊 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公玩白菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家家菊尽黄，梁国独如霜。\n莹静真琪树，分明对玉堂。\n仙人披雪氅，素女不红妆。\n粉蝶来难见，麻衣拂更香。\n向风摇羽扇，含露滴琼桨。\n高艳遮银井，繁枝覆象牀。\n桂丛慙竝发，梅蘂妬先芳。\n一入瑶华咏，从兹播乐章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}